sequenceDiagram
  actor Client
  participant UI as Pain UI
  participant API as Scoped API
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  Client->>UI: Save observation
  UI->>API: Actor auth + target + revision + mutation key
  API->>DB: Begin transaction, recheck access
  alt Access denied
    DB-->>API: No authorized target
    API-->>UI: 403, clear private state
  else Authorized
    API->>DB: Lock episode, inspect key and payload hash
    alt Same key committed
      DB-->>API: Existing result IDs
    else Revision conflict or changed payload
      DB-->>API: Conflict, no new observation
    else New valid mutation
      API->>DB: Append observation + update summary + replay record
      DB-->>API: Commit once
    end
    API-->>UI: Result or 409
  end
  alt Response lost after commit
    UI->>API: Recheck/replay SAME mutation key
    API->>DB: Reauthorize, read committed result
    API-->>UI: Original receipt
  end
  UI-->>Client: Saved receipt or specific recovery
